#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:361
msgid "Updated Twig Syntax"
msgstr "Sintassi Twig aggiornata"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:364
#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:459
msgid ""
"The following applies to phpBB 3.2 and later versions. If you must maintain "
"backwards compatibility with phpBB 3.1, please disregard this section."
msgstr ""
"Quanto segue si applica a phpBB 3.2 e versioni successive. Se devi mantenere"
" la retrocompatibilità con phpBB 3.1, ignora questa sezione."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:366
msgid ""
"If you are already using Twig template syntax, and you have been using loop "
"structures in your templates, you are probably familiar with the odd usage "
"of the ``loops`` prefix required in phpBB 3.1:"
msgstr ""
"Se stai già usando la sintassi di modello Twig, e hai usato strutture di "
"loop nei tuoi modelli, probabilmente hai familiarità con lo strano uso del "
"prefisso ``loops`` richiesto in phpBB 3.1:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:375
msgid ""
"As of phpBB 3.2, this requirement has been removed, allowing you to use "
"natural Twig syntax for looped structures (i.e. the ``loops`` prefix is no "
"longer needed):"
msgstr ""
"A partire da phpBB 3.2, questo requisito è stato rimosso, permettendoti di "
"usare la sintassi Twig naturale per le strutture in loop (cioè il prefisso "
"``loops`` non è più necessario):"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:384
msgid ""
"If you want to maintain backwards compatibility with phpBB 3.1, you must "
"continue using the ``loops`` prefix."
msgstr ""
"Se vuoi mantenere la retrocompatibilità con phpBB 3.1, devi continuare a "
"usare il prefisso ``loops``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:387
msgid "Updated Symfony Services"
msgstr "Service Symfony aggiornati"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:389
msgid ""
"The following changes are due to deprecations introduced in Symfony 2.8 "
"(which is used in phpBB 3.2). These deprecations are being removed from "
"Symfony 3 (which is used in phpBB 3.3)."
msgstr ""
"Le seguenti modifiche sono dovute a deprecazioni introdotte in Symfony 2.8 "
"(usato in phpBB 3.2). Queste deprecazioni vengono rimosse da Symfony 3 "
"(usato in phpBB 3.3)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:392
msgid "Deprecating special characters at the beginning of unquoted strings"
msgstr ""
"Deprecazione dei caratteri speciali all'inizio di stringhe senza virgolette"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:395
#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:439
msgid ""
"The following is recommended for phpBB 3.1 and later versions. It will be "
"required from phpBB 3.3 and later."
msgstr ""
"Quanto segue è raccomandato per phpBB 3.1 e versioni successive. Sarà "
"obbligatorio a partire da phpBB 3.3 e versioni successive."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:397
msgid ""
"According to Yaml specification, unquoted strings cannot start with ``@``, "
"``%``, `````, ``|`` or ``>``. You must wrap these strings with single or "
"double quotes:"
msgstr ""
"Secondo la specifica YAML, le stringhe senza virgolette non possono iniziare"
" con ``@``, ``%``, `````, ``|`` o ``>``. Devi racchiudere queste stringhe "
"tra virgolette singole o doppie:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:410
msgid "Deprecating Scopes and Introducing Shared Services"
msgstr "Deprecazione degli scope e introduzione degli shared service"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:413
msgid ""
"The following is a **required** change for phpBB 3.2 and later versions. It "
"is not backwards compatible with phpBB 3.1.  Extensions making this change "
"must release a new major version dropping support for 3.1."
msgstr ""
"Quanto segue è una modifica **obbligatoria** per phpBB 3.2 e versioni "
"successive. Non è retrocompatibile con phpBB 3.1. Le estensioni che "
"apportano questa modifica devono rilasciare una nuova versione principale "
"che abbandona il supporto per la 3.1."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:415
msgid ""
"By default, all services are shared services. This means a class is "
"instantiated once, and used each time you ask for it from the service "
"container."
msgstr ""
"Per impostazione predefinita, tutti i service sono shared service. Questo "
"significa che una classe viene istanziata una volta, e usata ogni volta che "
"la richiedi dal service container."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:417
msgid ""
"In some cases, however, it is desired to *unshare* a class, where a new "
"instance is created each time you ask for the service. An example of this is"
" the Notifications classes."
msgstr ""
"In alcuni casi, tuttavia, si desidera *disaccoppiare* (unshare) una classe, "
"dove viene creata una nuova istanza ogni volta che richiedi il service. Un "
"esempio di questo sono le classi Notifications."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:419
msgid ""
"In phpBB 3.1, this was defined in the ``services.yml`` by setting the "
"``scope`` option to ``prototype``:"
msgstr ""
"In phpBB 3.1, questo veniva definito in ``services.yml`` impostando "
"l'opzione ``scope`` su ``prototype``:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:427
msgid ""
"For phpBB 3.2, instead of ``scope``, service definitions must now configure "
"a ``shared`` option and set it to ``false`` to get the same result as in the"
" previous prototype scope:"
msgstr ""
"Per phpBB 3.2, invece di ``scope``, le definizioni di service devono ora "
"configurare un'opzione ``shared`` e impostarla su ``false`` per ottenere lo "
"stesso risultato del precedente scope prototype:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:436
msgid "Deprecating Route Pattern"
msgstr "Deprecazione del route pattern"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:441
msgid ""
"Older versions of Symfony and phpBB have allowed routes to be defined using "
"the keyword ``pattern``:"
msgstr ""
"Le versioni più vecchie di Symfony e phpBB permettevano di definire le route"
" usando la parola chiave ``pattern``:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:448
msgid ""
"For phpBB 3.2, route paths must instead be defined using the keyword "
"``path``:"
msgstr ""
"Per phpBB 3.2, i percorsi delle route devono invece essere definiti usando "
"la parola chiave ``path``:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:456
msgid "Updated INCLUDECSS"
msgstr "INCLUDECSS aggiornato"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:461
msgid ""
"As of phpBB 3.2, the ``INCLUDECSS`` template tag can now be called from "
"anywhere in a template, making it just as easy and flexible to implement "
"from any template event or file as the ``INCLUDEJS`` tag."
msgstr ""
"A partire da phpBB 3.2, il tag di modello ``INCLUDECSS`` può ora essere "
"chiamato da qualsiasi punto in un modello, rendendolo altrettanto facile e "
"flessibile da implementare da qualsiasi modelevent o file quanto il tag "
"``INCLUDEJS``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/new_in_rhea.rst:463
msgid ""
"Previously, in phpBB 3.1, extension's could only use this tag in the "
"``overall_header_head_append`` template event, or before including "
"``overall_header.html`` in a custom template file."
msgstr ""
"In precedenza, in phpBB 3.1, le estensioni potevano usare questo tag solo "
"nel modelevent ``overall_header_head_append``, o prima di includere "
"``overall_header.html`` in un file di modello personalizzato."

